The ionCube Loader runs the PHP files encoded with the ionCube PHP Encoder.

The loader of ionCube for PHP 8.2 on FreeBSD (ioncube_loaders_fre_11_x86-64,
binary only) for php82 of azsupport/ports: lib/php/20220829/ioncube_loader.so,
loaded before the other zend extensions by etc/php82/conf.d/ext-05-ioncube.ini.
It was built on FreeBSD 11: the kernel needs COMPAT_FREEBSD11.
